---
import Layout from '../../layouts/CostmateLegal.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="CostMate — Delete Your Account"
  description="How to delete your CostMate account and all associated data."
>
  <h1>Delete Your CostMate Account</h1>
  <p class="muted">App: CostMate (io.obura.costmate), published by Obura</p>

  <h2>Delete your account in the app (recommended)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open CostMate and sign in.</li>
    <li>Go to <strong>Settings</strong> (bottom-right tab).</li>
    <li>
      Scroll to the <strong>Account</strong> section and tap
      <strong>Delete account</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>Confirm. Your account is deleted immediately.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Or request deletion by email</h2>
  <p>
    If you can no longer sign in, email
    <a
      href="mailto:info@obura.io?subject=CostMate%20account%20deletion%20request"
      >info@obura.io</a
    >
    from the email address associated with your CostMate account, with the
    subject "CostMate account deletion request". We will delete the account and
    confirm within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
  <p>
    Deletion is permanent and removes <strong>all</strong> data associated with
    the account: your sign-in credentials (email/password and any linked Google
    identity), your business, materials, products, recipes, price history,
    equipment, expenses, and uploaded photos. No data is retained after
    deletion.
  </p>

  <p class="muted">
    See also: <a href="/costmate/privacy/">Privacy policy</a> ·
    <a href="/costmate/terms/">Terms of Service</a>
  </p>
</Layout>
